openrgb (1.1-1nano) unstable; urgency=low

  * New upstream bugfix release
    - Fix an issue with the "Do not show again" checkbox not saving
    - Fix an issue with the OpenRGB SDK server not replying to the plugin list request in headless mode
    - Fix an issue with the OpenRGB SDK server device indices on protocol versions < 6
    - Fix several issues with the command line interface regarding resizing, profile loading, and applying settings to devices
    - Device-specific improvements on several device controllers to improve hotplug behavior and fix potential deadlocks

 -- Christopher Roy Bratusek <nano@jpberlin.de>  Fri, 13 Nov 2026 21:06:41 +0100

